<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>6.6.2: Factoring Perfect Square Trinomials</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m01680</md:content-id>
    <md:title>6.6.2: Factoring Perfect Square Trinomials</md:title>
    <md:uuid>8259b338-2c43-4a08-ba22-0f1bb49d6488</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><title>Activity</title>
<para>Remember the patterns for perfect square trinomials:</para>
<para>\(a^2 + 2ab + b^2 = (a + b)^2\)</para>
<para>\(a^2 − 2ab + b^2 = (a − b)^2\)</para>
<para>Factor each perfect square trinomial. If necessary, factor out the GCF first. Use the "^" symbol to enter an exponent.</para>

<!--Text Entry Interaction Start -->
<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para> \(64y^2 − 80y + 25\) </para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para>\((8y − 5)^2\)</para>
  </solution></exercise>
<!--Interaction End -->


<!--Text Entry Interaction Start -->
<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para> \(16y^2 + 24y + 9\) </para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para>\((4y + 3)^2\)</para>
  </solution></exercise>
<!--Interaction End -->


<!--Text Entry Interaction Start -->
<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para> \(25n^2 − 120n + 144\) </para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para> \((5n − 12)^2\)</para>
  </solution></exercise>
<!--Interaction End -->


<!--Text Entry Interaction Start -->
<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para> \(100y^2 − 20y + 1\) </para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para>\((10y − 1)^2\)</para>
  </solution></exercise>
<!--Interaction End -->


<!--Text Entry Interaction Start -->
<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para> \(10jk^2 + 80jk + 160j\) </para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para> \(10j(k + 4)^2\)</para>
  </solution></exercise>
<!--Interaction End -->


<!--Text Entry Interaction Start -->
<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para> \(75u^4 − 30u^3v + 3u^2v^2\) </para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para>\(3u^2(5u − v)^2\)</para>
  </solution></exercise>
<!--Interaction End -->

